sequenceDiagram
    participant Guest as Guest code
    participant Dispatch as libdispatch
    participant Host as Host event loop

    Guest->>Dispatch: dispatch_async
    Dispatch->>Dispatch: enqueue and mark pending
    Dispatch->>Host: scheduler callback
    Note over Dispatch,Host: Repeated pokes retain one outstanding turn
    Dispatch-->>Guest: return before handler runs

    Host->>Dispatch: perform(max_steps, true)
    Dispatch->>Dispatch: consume scheduler latch
    Dispatch->>Dispatch: nonblocking harvest and drain phases
    alt runnable work remains
        Dispatch->>Host: request or retain one turn
    end
    Dispatch-->>Host: more_work and next timer delay

    Host->>Host: replace timeout for next deadline
    Host->>Dispatch: perform(max_steps, false)
    Note over Dispatch,Host: Timer turns preserve any queued scheduler turn
    Dispatch->>Dispatch: harvest due timer and drain phases
